{"id":"n72524-1-11","stage":2,"title":"앞길 · 前面的路","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72524-1-11-1","ko":"저 앞에서 시끄러운 소리가 나던데 무슨 일이야?","zh":"前面好像有很吵的声音，发生什么事了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那（指较远处）","explanation":"저：那（指较远处）","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71215","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"앞에서","meaning":"前，前面","explanation":"앞：前，前面；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"앞","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88648","senseId":"1","lemma":"앞","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앞에서","audio":"/audio/f32ce1c6132ddf4cbe9d.mp3"}},{"text":"시끄러운","meaning":"吵闹，喧嚣","explanation":"시끄럽다：吵闹，喧嚣；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"시끄럽다","audio":"/audio/72d1507eed9433fbf043.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15961","senseId":"1","lemma":"시끄럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시끄러운","audio":"/audio/74cbe50640672150a540.mp3"}},{"text":"소리가","meaning":"声音，声，音，动静","explanation":"소리：声音，声，音，动静；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"1","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소리가","audio":"/audio/0c12216fc63402c5db52.mp3"}},{"text":"나던데","meaning":"发出，泛出，响出，有","explanation":"나다：发出，泛出，响出，有；던데：回顾亲历的情况，作为后文的背景或对比。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"16","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나던데","audio":"/audio/8ed8aeea73f0e0e60de3.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"일이야?","meaning":"事，事情","explanation":"일：事，事情；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"3","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일이야","audio":"/audio/07685cceee2c1aebca4e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那（指较远处）","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71215","definition":"那（指较远处）","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"ec1a6b96ce688b70","term":"앞","zh":"前，前面","audio":"/audio/ec1a6b96ce688b70368d.mp3","entryId":"88648","definition":"所向的一面或地方。","pronunciation":["압"]},{"id":"72d1507eed9433fb","term":"시끄럽다","zh":"吵闹，喧嚣","audio":"/audio/72d1507eed9433fbf043.mp3","entryId":"15961","definition":"声音大而嘈杂，令人听起来厌烦。","pronunciation":["시끄럽따"]},{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"声音，声，音，动静","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"物体震动发出的音波传入耳朵中产生的响声。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发出，泛出，响出，有","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"产生能察觉到的声音或气味等。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带有某种内容的情况或事实。","pronunciation":["일ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/dbacfe8ea0480be37df7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72524-1-11-2","ko":"우리 아파트 앞길에서 교통사고가 났대.","zh":"据说我们公寓前面的路上发生了交通事故。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","sense